{"product_id":"buture-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-vc70","title":"Buture VC70 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner | 450W 38KPA","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Buture VC70 combines powerful suction with smart technology to make home cleaning easier than ever. This lightweight cordless vacuum features a 450W motor that effortlessly lifts dirt, dust, and pet hair from any surface. With smart suction adjustment, it automatically adapts to different floor types for optimal cleaning. Enjoy up to 55 minutes of runtime on a single charge, powered by a long-lasting battery. The advanced HEPA filtration system captures 99.9% of allergens, ensuring your home’s air is as clean as your floors. Plus, the anti-tangle brush head makes handling pet hair simple, leaving your home spotless without the hassle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhy Choose Buture VC70?\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1. Up to 55 Minutes of Super Long Runtime: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClean your entire home in one session with dual removable batteries offering up to 55 minutes of uninterrupted power in Eco mode. Say goodbye to frequent recharging and enjoy a more efficient, time-saving cleaning routine.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2. 38kPa \u0026amp; 450W of Powerful Suction: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEquipped with a robust 450W motor, the VC70 delivers an impressive 38kPa of suction power. This ensures that fine dust, dirt, and pet hair are effortlessly removed from any surface, whether it’s hardwood floors, carpets, or tiles. The powerful suction makes it ideal for homes with pets, tackling even the most stubborn debris in a single pass.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3. Intelligent Auto-Adjusting Suction: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VC70 features a cutting-edge intelligent automatic gear adjustment system. It can detect changes in floor resistance and automatically adjust the suction power, ensuring optimal performance on different surfaces. This feature not only enhances the cleaning efficiency but also helps to conserve battery life during intensive cleaning tasks.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e4. Enhanced LED Touchscreen Control: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VC70 comes with a significantly larger LED touchscreen, making it easier to switch between modes and monitor the vacuum's status. The interface is twice the size of previous models, providing a more user-friendly experience and giving you total control over your cleaning process with just a touch.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e5. Seven-Stage Advanced Filtration System:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eThis vacuum cleaner is designed with an advanced seven-stage filtration system, an upgrade from earlier models. It captures 99.9% of dust, allergens, and particles as small as 0.3 microns, ensuring that the air in your home remains clean and safe for your family.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e6. Anti-Tangle “S” Shaped Brush with LED Light:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eThe wide brush on this cordless vacuum comes equipped with an LED floor brush light, making it easy to see and pick up various particles. The \"S\"-shaped combination of soft and hard bristles efficiently collects hair and debris while minimizing tangles. Additionally, the side vents on the brush head allow you to clean right up against walls and easily capture debris from corners, ensuring nothing gets left behind.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e7. Versatile Cleaning Attachments: \u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo make your cleaning routine even more efficient, the VC70 comes with a variety of attachments, including an anti-tangle brush, a crevice tool, and a 2-in-1 brush head. These accessories make the vacuum versatile enough to handle different cleaning tasks, from tight spaces to upholstery, all with ease.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e8. Worry-Free Service: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYour purchase comes with a up to 3-year warranty, and 24\/7 customer support. We’re committed to providing you with a high-quality experience. If you encounter any issues, please don’t hesitate to reach out—we’re here to help!\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003ePerfect for Pet Owners and Allergy Sufferers\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEngineered with pets and allergy sufferers in mind, the Buture VC70 ensures a deep clean every time. With its powerful suction and advanced filtration, you can maintain a cleaner, healthier home effortlessly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure VC70 Specification\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .vc70-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .vc70-table th, .vc70-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .vc70-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .vc70-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"vc70-table\" style=\"width: 99.9676%; height: 274.4px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 46.9499%; height: 19.6px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFeature\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u00